{
    "background_story": "Jaxon was born with a rare condition known as ectopia cordis, where his heart was located outside of his chest. Despite the challenges and risks associated with this condition, Jaxon's parents were determined to give him a normal life. With the help of a team of dedicated doctors and nurses, Jaxon underwent numerous surgeries to correct his condition. As he grew older, Jaxon became an advocate for others born with rare congenital defects, using his platform to raise awareness and funds for research. His bravery and resilience inspired countless people, and he became a beacon of hope for families affected by ectopia cordis. Jaxon's story is a testament to the human spirit's ability to overcome even the most daunting challenges, and his determination to live a full and meaningful life despite the odds.",
